Package: raidhos
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, parted, dosfstools, exfatprogs, policykit-1
Recommends: gpg
Description: Memory-safe multi-ISO USB imager
 RaidhOS turns a USB stick into a multi-ISO boot drive in a few clicks.
 .
 The Rust core enforces `forbid(unsafe)`, the privileged helper is
 hardened with `clap` parsing plus a 64 KiB argv cap and a seccomp
 denylist, and every release is signed with cosign.
 .
 Includes the CLI, the privileged helper (the only binary that needs
 root), and a polkit policy.
